      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was created to legalize alcohol sales in an otherwise mostly‑dry county, giving locals a new social hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carl's_Corner%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In the early 1980s, Willie Nelson held Fourth of July concerts on Cornelius' property beside the truck stop, drawing music fans.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
